## Invocation

```
/audit
```

### Flags (optional)

- `--days=N` -- Lookback window (default: 7 days)
- `--source=<name>` -- Limit scan to: `slack`, `granola`, `archives` (default: all)
- `--quick` -- Skip Granola and archives, just do Slack commitment scan + Trello diff

