## Forbidden Shortcuts

| Shortcut | Why It's Forbidden |
|----------|-------------------|
| Skipping Primary Slack scan | Institutional commitments live there |
| Skipping Granola | Meeting action items are the most commonly dropped |
| Skipping DM scan | 1:1 commitments are high-accountability |
| Auto-applying changes without approval | Christopher decides what's real |
| Only scanning outbound commitments | Inbound requests ("can you...") matter too |
| Fuzzy matching without showing evidence | Christopher needs to see the source to judge |
| Running in place of `/checkin` | Different tool, different purpose, different cadence |
| Creating multiple cards for one action | One action = one card (sub-steps in description) |

